Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:10.08,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,My name is Ilza.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:11.78,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,My name is Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:17.36,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,When I have other business to attend to, \Nthese two will tend to your needs in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:21.52,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Someone like me is being given \Nattendants? Two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.95,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm certain I'll \Nbe too careful around them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.13,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,but this is common practice \Namong the aristocracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:32.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My name is Marie Shaderan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:34.75,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I look forward to your kind assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:39.27,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:43.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Might the two of you be \Nfrom the royal capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:45.47,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Yes. We are both born of knight's houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.47,0:00:48.92,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,We've come here at the \Nrecommendation of the third prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:51.31,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,We've both served in the \Nroyal palace, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.31,0:00:54.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The royal palace? That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:59.38,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Still, stories of the royal capital for \Na noble such as yourself, Lady Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:02.54,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,They could hardly be novel \Nfor you, could they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.89,0:01:05.33,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:07.47,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,For some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:09.71,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:12.97,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd like your breakfast now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:15.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:52.52,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,559)\blur2\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H404040&\4c&HB1B2A4&\fs15\pos(457,320)}Episode 3 "A Life I Saw in a Dream, and a Dream-like Life"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:53.07,Default Top,Marie,0,0,0,,I-Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:56.81,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The appetizer is a charcuterie \Nassortment of seven items.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:58.47,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,There is pork ham and sausage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:02:59.78,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The terrine is pheasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:03.51,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The pâté de campagne is duck and venison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.27,0:03:06.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Th-There are quite a lot of animals here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:09.89,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,We have prepared a number of \Ndifferent dishes for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:12.04,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,so please let me know which you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.41,0:03:15.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,B-Both my palate and my stomach are lacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:17.47,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,so I doubt I'll be \Nable to finish all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:22.15,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You need only eat what you like. Please \Nleave anything you are unable to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.15,0:03:24.35,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, I couldn't! It would be such a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.35,0:03:26.90,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Those are the master's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:29.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Where is Lord Kyros now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:30.72,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,He is out on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:33.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Then, would you like half of—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:36.73,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,A servant may not eat with their master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:39.86,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\c&H47413B&\3c&HE1C9C0&\shad0}There's nothing left for me to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:39.85,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,There's nothing left for me to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.73,0:03:44.49,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,This is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:47.16,Default Top,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(275,1)\b1\shad0\c&HE7FBFB&\3c&HB36B2F&\bord3}This is delicious, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:47.16,Italics,Marie,0,0,0,,This is delicious, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.59,0:03:48.63,Italics,Marie,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:54.71,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\shad0\bord3\pos(41,4)\c&H0024C1&\3c&HEFEFEF&}Fullness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(401,432)\fs30\shad0\bord3\b1\pos(167,51)\c&H67484B&\3c&HF7E9EA&}URP
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:58.27,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, you mustn't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:04:01.28,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No, it's all delicious,\Nso I still have some room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.21,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\shad0\bord3\c&H0024C1&\3c&HEFEFEF&\fad(279,1)\move(582,21,550,9,112,529)}Fullness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:07.28,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please don't try to exceed your limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:14.81,Italics,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. Those poor \Ningredients. And the chef, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:19.51,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,After you've rested a little,\NI will show you around the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:22.65,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You may find a change of clothes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:28.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:30.08,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A-A magnificent sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But I only have one body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.67,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I am aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:38.43,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,In addition to these, there are others befitting \Nother seasons, over a hundred prepared in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.43,0:04:39.74,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A hundred?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:42.68,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please choose what you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:43.14,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:47.05,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Something... I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:49.06,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Is there nothing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:50.08,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:54.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,They're all so lovely, I don't \Nknow what I should choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:56.81,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Then let's settle on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:58.43,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:03.98,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It suits you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.67,0:05:06.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.40,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Then, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:10.03,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Granado Castle was built
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.03,0:05:13.17,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,to protect the kingdom's borders\Nfrom the front lines during the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:17.90,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The House of Granado, margraves at the \Ntime, constructed it to be a fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:22.67,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,If I recall, House Granado has \Nties to the royal family, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:27.75,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes, but after the war, they attained the rank \Nof duke and now simply govern their own lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:29.89,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,They are not in the line of succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:31.01,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:34.47,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,This castle is used only\Nfor special functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:38.39,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, let me show you to \Nthe manor house where you will be residing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.39,0:05:39.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Manor house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:42.81,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,We'll go through this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.99,0:05:56.65,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:06:00.79,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,514)}This manor house was built \Nby Duchess Liu Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:02.22,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The first floor houses the kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:05.77,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,and also serves as a residence \Nfor live-in staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:08.68,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,There are also private rooms \Nfor the duchess' family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:11.55,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,and facilities for entertaining \Nimportant guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:20.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Excuse me, it's Mister Tomas, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:23.96,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for my father's \Ninexcusably rude behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:26.15,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,My lady, how do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:28.46,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I thought I heard someone call you by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:30.11,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,You're right! That's my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.77,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,That makes me sort of happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:36.99,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself. \NI'm Marie Shaderan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:40.16,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,My name is Dibomov Tomas Tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:42.34,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Please call me Tomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:43.58,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Dibomov?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:47.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Are you named for the hero Dibomov \Nwho discovered Louhav Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:47.50,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.73,0:06:50.85,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you know about \Nhim! I'm from Louhav Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:53.81,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,My lady, you're incredibly knowledgeable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.97,0:07:00.78,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie is the master's fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:02.40,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Do not touch her without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.35,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I apologize...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.30,0:07:10.32,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The castle was lovely,\Nbut this room is wonderful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:12.40,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:16.89,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, does Lord Kyros conduct \Nbusiness with countries all over the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:20.83,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,No. Essentially, he only trades \Nwith the Ipsandros Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:25.12,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I wondered because I saw folk crafts from \Nother countries all around the manor house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.12,0:07:27.51,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Those are the servants' personal items.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:36.60,Default,text; left ribbon,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs17\pos(145,116)\c&H663D5F&\3c&HE8C1D8&}Nations of Bandelee
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:36.60,Default,text; right ribbon,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs17\c&H1D201F&\3c&H66DC98&\pos(496,106)}Flaria
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:36.60,Default,text; bottom ribbon,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs17\c&H424934&\3c&HF2FCD0&\pos(294,235)}Other Countries
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:31.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The head chef is from Flaria. The gardener \Nis from the Nations of Bandelee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:32.99,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,We have many nationalities here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:36.60,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,There's Tomas, for one, \Nbut it's quite a diverse group, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:39.03,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The master is perverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.03,0:07:39.51,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:41.99,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,In this kingdom, prejudice \Nis a matter of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:45.76,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,but the master hires promising \Nindividuals regardless of origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:48.45,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Which is why everyone \Nhere is devoted to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.77,0:07:51.82,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I see. Mio, are you from the royal capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:53.71,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I was an abandoned child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:56.02,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm told that I was left at a roadside inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:57.73,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:59.74,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,There's no need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.74,0:08:02.31,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I've lived quite an enjoyable life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:05.36,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,When the master was little, \NI used to comfort him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:07.72,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Wait. How old is Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:11.51,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,As you can see, \Nmany of us have difficult backgrounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:15.17,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,but Ilza and Hannah are worthy \Nof being your attendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:19.94,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Both of them possess the dignity of \Nnobles born here in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:24.89,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I'd actually rather hear \Nstories of other countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.89,0:08:27.33,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Folk songs about old heroes, \Nlearned by heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.33,0:08:30.25,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The call of an enormous bird with \Nrainbow-colored feathers...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:31.86,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:34.94,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you for going to \Nso much trouble for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:38.78,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'll learn as much as I can so that \NI don't embarrass any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:48.45,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Your after-dinner tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:54.04,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,M-May I have some milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.04,0:08:55.67,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:58.87,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I often add milk to my black tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:01.68,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What do you add to your tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:03.32,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Milk in your black tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:05.28,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,Doesn't that ruin the flavor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:06.05,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:10.14,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Putting cow's milk in tea? \NWhat a novel way to drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:12.35,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,It's the first I've ever heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:17.74,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,I'd expect nothing less of you, Lady Marie! \NYou're so free in your sensibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.33,0:09:21.96,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be an issue in terms \Nof aristocratic etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:27.33,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Oh! Perhaps neither of them like milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:30.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I don't think \NI'll need any after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:33.36,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'll drink it like this. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:44.51,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Today was a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:48.65,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I wonder if Lord Kyros is still \Nbusy this late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:09:58.83,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I wonder if Marie is enjoying herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:00.25,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:03.78,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,tomorrow, you have a traders meeting in the \Nmorning, a lunch meeting in the afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:05.69,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,and following that, a market inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.90,0:10:09.77,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,When will I be able to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:12.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\pos(479,247)\c&H17383F&\3c&HDBF1F7&}〜A few days later〜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:24.35,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\fs20\pos(56,185)\c&H678252&\3c&H8FD9FB&\b1}MUNCH
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.23,0:10:21.82,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Breakfast today is large, as usual,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:24.35,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\fs20\c&H678252&\3c&H8FD9FB&\b1\pos(435,41)}MUNCH
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:24.35,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\fs20\c&H678252&\3c&H8FD9FB&\b1\pos(118,38)}MUNCH
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:24.35,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\fs20\c&H678252&\3c&H8FD9FB&\b1\pos(494,191)}MUNCH
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:24.20,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,but the crisp juiciness of the \Nvegetables is so comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:29.25,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mio, where do you procure\Nthese delicious vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:31.98,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,They're from the vegetable \Ngarden in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:34.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?! There's a vegetable garden?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:36.85,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes. Johan works very hard at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:40.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'd like to see the vegetable garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:47.66,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I must prepare \Nfor the master's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:49.46,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please take Ilza and Hannah with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:51.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:53.37,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:11:00.04,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I hope this opportunity helps me \Nto grow closer to both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:16.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I had no idea such a beautiful\Nvegetable garden was so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:20.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.44,0:11:26.84,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mister Johan, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:30.08,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,Hello. I hope you are well, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.55,0:11:32.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.37,0:11:34.77,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,those are tomato seedlings, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:36.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Are you getting ready to plant them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.17,0:11:40.73,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. This year's seedlings \Nhave grown quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:42.82,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, it is that time of year, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:45.54,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,My lady, could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:48.26,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,that you've grown vegetables yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:49.17,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:50.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\shad0\fs30\pos(524,76)\c&H6A41C0&\3c&HF1EBFD&}Cheap
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:50.73,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's less expensive than buying them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:52.23,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\shad0\fs30\c&HBD8615&\3c&HFCEED1&\pos(82,60)}Salable
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:52.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,and if there's extra, they can be sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:57.11,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnArial\b1\fs26\c&H6E84E8&\3c&HE2FCFD&\t(773,3468,1 \fs16)\move(20,20,12,13,773,3693)}Delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:57.11,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\b1\fs26\c&H7C5CC4&\3c&HF1ECFC&\t(773,3468,1 \fs16)\move(552,20,320,14,815,3693)}Simple
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:56.24,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,For a house as poor as ours, \Nour garden was a lifeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:57.10,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:12:00.94,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But tomatoes are susceptible to bugs and \Ndisease, so they were difficult to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:04.97,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. How far apart should \Nthe seedlings be spaced?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:09.62,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,Come this way. You can leave \Nthe seedlings where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.83,0:12:13.54,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You're going to show me? Oh, I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:20.92,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,I don't believe it. She was \Nabout to walk on the bare dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:25.17,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,Perhaps she isn't aware that gardens are \Nmeant to be looked at and not walked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:28.30,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,It's inconceivable. There are \Nbugs and that gardener in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:30.98,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,Wait, perhaps the lady likes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:33.35,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Likes what? The bugs? The gardener?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:35.72,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,Oh, you! I meant the bugs, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:38.35,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Of course. After all, no one \Ncould possibly like that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:39.89,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,How can they be so rude?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:44.50,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I may be deserving of ridicule,\N but Mr. Johan certainly isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:47.12,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No, it isn't like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.50,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:56.66,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,These beautiful shoes were \Ngiven to me by the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.42,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I mustn't get these shoes dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:02.74,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:07.77,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Then, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:10.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:24.35,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,For some reason, I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.02,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll ask for some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:30.65,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Someone is awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:35.29,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:39.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Can't you sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:40.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:44.76,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I returned late, so I missed dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:46.13,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, please have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.14,0:13:49.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,P-Pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:54.66,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's been four days, hasn't it? \NYou've grown even more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:58.84,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Not at all. I've been indulging myself \Nin the kindness of everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:01.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, you're always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:06.95,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,My heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:08.11,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Apologies for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:10.83,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Oh! Toppo, you're still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:13.96,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Welcome home, young sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:15.03,Italics,Toppo,0,0,0,,Stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:17.91,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Let's see. I think Toppo is \Nthe head chef, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.65,0:14:20.96,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,You asked for something light,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:23.25,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,so this is chicken and cassava \Nin a salt-based soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:25.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, it smells delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.83,0:14:27.84,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Toppo, give Marie a serving, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:29.85,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:33.35,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Though I'm not sure it will \Nsuit your tastes, Lady Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:35.61,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I feel like he's being rather prickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:38.82,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,This is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:41.10,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It's simple, but it has \Nsuch depth of flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:43.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Toppo's cooking is delicious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:47.75,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, it truly is! The food here \Nis always so delicious, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:53.63,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,There's no need for polite flattery!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:55.66,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No, but I truly mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:15:00.83,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,No matter what I try, you never,\Never finish all your food! I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:04.35,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,It's because I, Toppo, lack the \Nskills! But the ingredients!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.35,0:15:07.92,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,The meat and fish and... \NI just feel so {\i1}sorry{\i0} for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:11.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Th-This is a misunderstanding! I don't \Nleave the food because it tastes bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.01,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:15.71,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I felt badly for wasting \Nall those ingredients, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:17.56,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:22.48,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio, didn't you ask Marie what she liked?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:27.90,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Whether it's food or dresses, Lady Marie is \Nunable to say that she dislikes something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:30.30,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,N-No, all of it truly has been delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:32.08,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,There wasn't anything that I disliked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:33.95,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,My lady, is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:37.88,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's true! I got full and couldn't \Neat anymore, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:41.93,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Then you were pleased with \Nthe food? I'm so {\i1}glad!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:44.22,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,M-Mio, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:46.71,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll go make some tea to end your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:47.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:49.58,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:51.91,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Toppo is always quick to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:53.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:59.13,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,I, Toppo, had no idea that my \Nlady felt that way, and {\i1}yet{\i0} I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.39,0:16:03.06,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,I will pull myself together \Nand bring your dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:07.78,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Now, here you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:09.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.60,0:16:11.62,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,How many apples did it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.61,0:16:13.98,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,The reason it didn't occur to Toppo
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.78,Default Top,Toppo; background,0,0,0,,I'll portion it out for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:17.83,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,is that he doesn't understand that \Nothers can't eat as much as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.29,0:16:19.87,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Let's all eat it together, Toppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:21.71,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,What?! You wouldn't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:22.93,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:30.21,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\bord2\b1\fs20\c&HE7AF31&\3c&HF0FFFF&\pos(634,3)}Ended up\Neating half
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.77,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Well then, I shall take my leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:30.21,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,A good night to you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:32.69,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you, Toppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.69,0:16:33.80,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:37.43,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:38.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:41.05,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I created a situation that forced you \Nto consider others first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.05,0:16:44.39,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Is there anything besides the \Nfood that you've found trying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:48.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Everything is so wonderful \Nit seems a shame to waste it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:49.59,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What about Ilza and Hannah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:53.73,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,They take good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:57.51,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,A friend of mine recommended them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:59.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You are a future duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:02.70,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I want you to be received in a \Nmanner that befits that station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:04.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:06.63,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,They really are treating me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.07,0:17:10.76,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, your habit of enduring \Nunpleasantness is a dire one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:11.43,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:15.20,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Just because someone is treating you well
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:17.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,doesn't mean that you're \Nobliged to be happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:22.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,And if you aren't happy about \Nit, then you can just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:25.31,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I don't have any preferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.31,0:17:29.33,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,No. I don't understand what \Nit means to pick what I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:33.99,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I did the work that needed to be done \Nand accepted what was given to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:34.96,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:38.94,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It can't possibly be all right for \Nme to choose based on my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:45.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Lord Kyros. I don't want to \Nsquander a single one of your kindnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:49.46,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, if you lack for something, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:52.94,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I will give you everything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:58.76,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Something I lack?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:01.34,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be anything, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:03.96,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Pardon me for interrupting \Nyour conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:07.93,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Oh! I see you've brought \Nsomething very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:10.53,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Something nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.89,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Then please relax and enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:21.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\shad0\\pos(588,44)\c&H487ED9&\3c&HC5FDF2&}Piled High
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:20.47,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It's so big! Is that Mio's late-night snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:21.34,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.28,0:18:23.67,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Do you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:26.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,N-No. It's the first time I've seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:30.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's called a çaydanlik, and it's \Nused to make tea in Ipsandros.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:34.38,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,First, you light the bottom \Nsection to boil the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:36.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The heat of the water rises upwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.75,0:18:40.72,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,slowly steaming the tea leaves \Nand bringing out their flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:44.63,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,When the time is right, you pour hot water \Nfrom the bottom pot into the top pot,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.63,0:18:47.11,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,then place the pots back in their \Noriginal positions and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.15,0:18:49.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,When the tea is ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:52.17,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,you use the remaining hot \Nwater to dilute it to taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:55.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,So everyone can adjust it to \Ntheir preferred strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:55.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord2\shad0\fs30\fnArial\fad(153,1)\c&HAAAE59&\3c&HE6FEE5&}Tea is Ready
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:59.32,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Everyone gathers around the \Npot, waiting for it to brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:03.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,They ask each other's preferences \Nand grow closer to one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:05.46,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,So then, Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:08.34,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,please tell me about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:10.57,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,O-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:12.18,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Tell him about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:14.16,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But what should I tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:17.57,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I've never experienced \Nanything fun in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.07,0:19:20.17,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie! Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:22.05,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,What do you want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.42,0:19:24.22,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,I want to play...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:25.94,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Word-chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.51,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros, let's play word-chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:30.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(399,1)\an7\fnArial\shad0\c&HA9AD66&\3c&H00DCF7&\b1\pos(6,16)}Stunned
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:30.19,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Word-chains?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:33.69,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Why would someone in his exalted \Nposition play word-chains?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.10,0:19:33.69,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,1)\an8\shad0\b1\fnTahoma\fs22\c&H60A056&\3c&H6BE6F7&\frz25.94\pos(240,20)}Count
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:33.69,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(228,1)\an8\shad0\b1\fnTahoma\fs22\c&H60A056&\3c&H6BE6F7&\frz346.3\fs20\pos(67,7)}24 year-old
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:33.69,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(279,1)\an8\shad0\b1\fnTahoma\fs22\c&H60A056&\3c&H6BE6F7&\fs20\pos(45,205)\frz38.64}Ultra Wealthy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:36.66,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,What a childish thing to think \Nof. I'm so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.24,0:19:39.94,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,In order to enjoy a game \Nof word-chains at our age,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:41.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,we'll need to add a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Let's focus on areas where\N our knowledge overlaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:48.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? I-In that case, what about \Nthings you like, Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:51.01,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,All right. It's limited \Nto things that we like!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:52.35,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Is it all right if I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:53.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,O-Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:54.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Then here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:56.43,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.09,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:19:59.77,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Don't you usually start with "A"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:01.97,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,In that case, apple pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:06.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,"E"... Something I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.15,0:20:10.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Exciting Ipsandrian stories!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.91,0:20:13.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You said the same thing \Nthat night, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.45,0:20:16.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:19.84,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You should visit the \Ncastle library sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:22.04,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm certain it's full of \Nthings you'll love, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, I will. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:27.87,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Next is the "s" from "stories." "S"...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:29.49,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Sweet ricotta cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:31.41,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,"E"... Early zucchini!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.41,0:20:32.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Iconic gnocchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.47,0:20:33.32,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Inexpensive carrots!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:34.93,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Simple tompouce cakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.93,0:20:36.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Sweet potato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:37.77,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Opulent chocolate truffles!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:38.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Stalks of rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:39.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Elegant soufflé.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:40.67,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Early lettuces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.97,0:20:43.06,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,"S"... "S"...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.06,0:20:45.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Stroopwafel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:46.58,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Looseleaf rooibos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:47.93,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,"S" again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:51.32,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,"S"... "S"... There aren't any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:53.51,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,S-Sponge cake stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:57.92,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros, you've only been naming sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:21:00.71,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What about you, Marie? \NYou're only listing agricultural goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:02.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:05.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Vegetables grow large very \Nquickly, so they're economical,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:07.66,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,and they're delicious in many recipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:09.46,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That's so like you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.77,0:21:10.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.38,0:21:11.97,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm sorry. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:13.33,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Come on. Next is "K."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:17.29,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Something I like that starts with "K"...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:19.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:24.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I feel like I heard something \Nthat ends in "S."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:29.24,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I said, "kiss."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:33.39,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I see. I see. So, Marie, you like kisses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.39,0:21:35.19,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, that isn't what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:38.29,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Hmm. But "S" again, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:40.14,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Souvenirs by area!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:41.73,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Aromatherapy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.11,0:21:42.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You, Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:46.30,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, honestly! This person \Nis really just too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:47.58,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You're still playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:48.90,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:52.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The tea...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.47,0:21:54.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,is cold, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:55.87,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs30\b1\pos(379,25)\c&H45DFF1&\3c&H365DC1&\shad0\bord3}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.13,0:22:08.85,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's no good.\N It's bitter because it's over-brewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.85,0:22:11.26,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Let's sweeten and mask \Nthe flavor with milk and sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.71,0:22:18.03,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I don't believe the two of you \Nrequire any further sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:22.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.74,0:22:24.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,She's already gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.95,0:24:02.01,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie doesn't believe the \Nmaster feels the way he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:06.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,She doesn't feel she can truly \Nsettle into life at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.21,0:24:10.32,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,But I think I understand a \Nlittle of how she feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.29,0:24:15.00,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,After all, I was once \Nin a similar situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.13,0:24:21.74,Default Top,Mio,0,0,0,,Next Time, "I've Found the Things I Like".
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.27,0:24:27.01,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,1)\pos(427,320)\4c&H8F8C8B&\3c&H383838&\c&HCDD2D9&}Episode 4 "I've Found the Things I Like."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:26.77,Default Top,Mio,0,0,0,,You know what will happen to you \Nif you don't watch, don't you?
